---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro'
import IconGithub from '../components/icons/IconGithub.astro'
import IconSteam from '../components/icons/IconSteam.astro'
import IconDiscord from '../components/icons/IconDiscord.astro'

const formatter = Intl.DateTimeFormat('zh-CN', {
  dateStyle: 'medium',
  timeStyle: 'short',
})

const date = new Date()
---

<Layout title="About">
  <PageHeader title="About" />

  <article>
    <h2>关于我</h2>
    <p>我是 Realloon，兴趣驱动的个人开发者。</p>

    <h2>技术栈</h2>
    <p>
      以 TypeScript 为主要开发语言，掌握 Vue、React、Astro、Nuxt 等前端框架。
    </p>
    <p>具备前后端开发、部署及运维能力，维护着多个全栈项目。</p>
    <p>使用 C# 开发 RimWorld Mod 及 CLI 应用。</p>

    <h2>个人代表项目</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/realloon/RimSage">RimSage</a></li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://github.com/realloon/CustomizeWeapon"
          >Customize Weapon</a
        >
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://github.com/realloon/markflow">Markflow</a> & <a
          href="https://github.com/realloon/aura">Aura</a>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>找到我</h2>
    <ul class="link">
      <li>
        <a href="https://github.com/realloon">
          <IconGithub />
          <span>我开发的项目</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/id/sincerajn/">
          <IconSteam />
          <span>我发布的 RimWorld Mod</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://discord.com/users/muyun8281">
          <IconDiscord />
          <span>在 Discord 上联系我</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>关于本站</h2>
    <p>
      本站使用 Astro 框架开发，代码托管在 Github，部署于 Cloudflare Workers。
    </p>
    <p>
      本站界面设计受 <a href="https://ramsayleung.github.io/"
        >Ramsay’s personal blog</a
      > 启发，感谢作者 <a href="https://github.com/ramsayleung">ramsayleung</a
      >。
    </p>
    <p>
      最近构建于：<time datetime={date.toISOString()}
        >{formatter.format(date)}</time
      > 。
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .link {
    list-style-type: none;
    padding-inline-start: 0.5em;

    a {
      width: fit-content;
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.5em;
    }
  }
</style>
